OL,3,GNEWSAChild neglect arrests after baby
OL,4,Adies
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested following
OL,7,Fthe death of a one-year-old girl.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,10,Fhome in Atherstone in Warwickshire at
OL,11,Fabout 11:50 BST to reports of a child
OL,12,Fin cardiac arrest. She was pronounced
OL,13,Fdead at the scene a short while later,
OL,14,Fpolice said.
OL,16,FA man and a woman were arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of child neglect and they
OL,18,Fremain in custody.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
